   "source": [
    "# Giornata 1 — API low-level dei tensori (ricostruito)\n",
    "\n",
    "Ricostruito dai frame del video: a lezione il docente lavorava su `10-06-2025.ipynb`,\n",
    "notebook costruito dal vivo e **mai distribuito** nel materiale del corso.\n",
    "\n",
    "Le celle marcate **ERRORE ATTESO** devono fallire: sono gli errori che il docente\n",
    "dimostra apposta. Se falliscono altre celle, la trascrizione e' da correggere."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 22. Ricostruzione dell'ambiente e apertura sui tensori"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import tensorflow as tf\n",
    "import numpy as np"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "tf.config.get_visible_devices()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# variables, data types (tensor)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "row, col = 3, 3"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 23. Creare un tensore: shape e dtype"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# zeros\n",
    "zeros = tf.zeros(\n",
    "    shape=[row, col],\n",
    "    dtype=tf.float32\n",
    ")\n",
    "zeros"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 24. Tensori precompilati: zeros, ones, constant, fill, zeros_like"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# ones\n",
    "ones = tf.ones([row, col])\n",
    "ones"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "constant = tf.constant([\n",
    "    [2, 2, 2],\n",
    "    [2, 2, 2],\n",
    "    [2, 2, 2]\n",
    "], dtype=tf.float32)\n",
    "constant"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "constant.shape"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "constant.dtype"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "filled = tf.fill(\n",
    "    [row, col],\n",
    "    2.0\n",
    ")\n",
    "filled"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "zeros_like = tf.zeros_like(constant)\n",
    "zeros_like"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "list(constant.shape)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 25. linspace e range"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# linear space\n",
    "linear_space = tf.linspace(\n",
    "    start=0.0,\n",
    "    stop=1.0,\n",
    "    num=10\n",
    ")\n",
    "linear_space"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "range_tns = tf.range(\n",
    "    start=0,\n",
    "    limit=1,\n",
    "    delta=0.1111\n",
    ")\n",
    "range_tns"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 26. Tensori casuali e a cosa servono"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# random normals\n",
    "random_normal_tns = tf.random.normal(\n",
    "    shape=[row, col],\n",
    "    mean=0.0,\n",
    "    stddev=1.0\n",
    ")\n",
    "random_normal_tns"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# random uniform in a set\n",
    "random_uniform = tf.random.uniform(\n",
    "    shape=[row, col],\n",
    "    minval=0,\n",
    "    maxval=10\n",
    ")\n",
    "random_uniform"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 28. reshape, squeeze, expand_dims"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "a = tf.range(row * col - 1)\n",
    "a.shape"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# [ERRORE ATTESO: InvalidArgumentError]\n",
    "b = tf.reshape(\n",
    "    a,\n",
    "    (row, col)\n",
    ")\n",
    "b"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "sx = tf.random.normal([1, 10, 1, 30])\n",
    "sx.shape"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "sx_squeezed = tf.squeeze(sx)\n",
    "sx_squeezed.shape"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "sx_expanded = tf.expand_dims(\n",
    "    sx_squeezed,\n",
    "    axis=1\n",
    ")\n",
    "sx_expanded.shape"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "sx_original = tf.expand_dims(\n",
    "    sx_expanded,\n",
    "    axis=0\n",
    ")\n",
    "sx_original.shape"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "sx.numpy() == sx_original.numpy()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 29. transpose e tile"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "tb = tf.random.normal(\n",
    "    [100, 64, 51]\n",
    ")\n",
    "tb.shape"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "tb_transposed = tf.transpose(\n",
    "    tb,\n",
    "    perm=[1, 2, 0]\n",
    ")\n",
    "tb_transposed.shape"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# tiles (extra)\n",
    "tile = tf.constant([[1, 2], [3, 4]])\n",
    "tile"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "tiled = tf.tile(\n",
    "    tile,\n",
    "    [2, 2]\n",
    ")\n",
    "tiled.numpy()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 30. Costanti e variabili: mutabilità e derivazione automatica"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "ca = tf.constant(2)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# [ERRORE ATTESO: AttributeError]\n",
    "ca.assign(4)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "cv = tf.Variable(2)\n",
    "cv.numpy()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "cv.assign(4)\n",
    "cv.numpy()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "id(ca)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 31. Operazioni fra tensori: matmul contro multiply"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# operations\n",
    "\n",
    "a = tf.constant([[1,2], [3,4]])\n",
    "b = tf.constant([[5,6], [7, 8]])\n",
    "c = tf.matmul(a, b)\n",
    "c.numpy()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "ec = tf.multiply(a,b)\n",
    "ec"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# [CELLA MANCANTE - illeggibile nei frame]\n",
    "# A TF-02 @ 00:49:00 il docente sta scrivendo 'mm = tf.constant()' ma la cella e' ancora\n",
    "# vuota; a 00:49:49 la vista e' gia' scrollata sul traceback. Gli argomenti non compaiono\n",
    "# in nessun frame disponibile.\n",
    "# Cio' che si deduce dall'errore: mm NON e' quadrata, perche' matmul(mm, mm) fallisce con\n",
    "# 'Matrix size-incompatible'. Il valore esatto non e' ricostruibile: va riguardato il video\n",
    "# a TF-02 @ 00:49:00-00:49:49.\n",
    "mm = tf.constant([[1, 2, 3], [4, 5, 6]])   # SEGNAPOSTO, non e' il valore usato a lezione"
   ],
   "execution_count": null,
   "outputs": []
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
